---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import Avatar from '../assets/avatar.webp';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
        title="About Patrick Scheid - Engineering Manager"
        description="Engineering Manager at STACKIT, leading the Identity and Access Management team. 10+ years in backend engineering and 2+ years in engineering management, with a background in AI products, data engineering, and product ownership."
        pageClass="site page-about"
>
    <section class="grid intro">
        <div class="index">
            <Image src={Avatar} alt="Portrait of Patrick Scheid" class="avatar" width={192} height={192}/>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h1>About</h1>
            <p class="lede">Hi, I'm Patrick Scheid, an Engineering Manager at STACKIT, where I lead the Identity and Access Management team. With 10+ years building and scaling backend systems and 2+ years leading engineering teams, I bridge deep hands-on engineering in C#, Kotlin, and Go with a strong understanding of team dynamics, system design trade-offs, and cross-functional alignment.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">What I do</h2>
        <p class="body-text">At STACKIT, I lead the Identity and Access Management team, based at the Schwarz Digits campus in Bad Friedrichshall. Before that, at DeepL, I led teams of up to 8 engineers integrating LLM research into editing tools serving 500k+ daily users and scaled document translation to 150k+ documents per day, then returned to hands-on backend work as a senior engineer.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">What I bring</h2>
        <ul class="ledger compact">
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">AI / ML</span>
                <p class="ledger-text">Integrating LLM research into production editing tools serving 500k+ daily users at DeepL. Custom quality metrics, model evaluation, and end-to-end productionisation.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Backend Engineering</span>
                <p class="ledger-text">Building scalable systems in C#, Kotlin, and Go. Operated ~60 microservices on Kubernetes/AWS with Kafka, gRPC, and PostgreSQL.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Data Engineering</span>
                <p class="ledger-text">End-to-end data pipelines, ETL design, and feature engineering. Built data analysis tools and validation pipelines for spectroscopy-based ML systems.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Product Ownership</span>
                <p class="ledger-text">Evolved a platform API into an API-as-a-Product with developer experience strategy, DX conversion funnel, and monetisation at Ryte.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Engineering Management</span>
                <p class="ledger-text">Led teams of up to 8 engineers at DeepL. Hiring, mentoring, performance development, and guiding teams through reorgs and strategic shifts.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">Career</h2>
        <ul class="ledger">
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Engineering Manager</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">STACKIT &middot; Oct 2026 &ndash; Present</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Leading the Identity and Access Management team at the Schwarz Digits campus in Bad Friedrichshall.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Senior Software Engineer</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">DeepL &middot; Feb &ndash; Sep 2026</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Returned to an IC role to deepen technical impact, contributing to AI-powered writing and translation products with a focus on backend architecture, system reliability, and cross-team technical leadership.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Engineering Manager</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">DeepL &middot; Dec 2023 &ndash; Feb 2026</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Editor Team: Led 8 engineers bridging AI research and production editing tools serving 500k+ daily users. Drove integration of LLM-based prototypes into product. Document Translation Team: Led 6 engineers scaling document translation to 150k+ docs/day, defined custom quality metrics, and led a focused initiative on PDF layout preservation.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Senior Software Engineer</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">DeepL &middot; Aug &ndash; Dec 2023</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Designed scalable C# backend services for document translation. Improved processing reliability for complex formats (PPTX, DOCX, PDF) and contributed to architectural decisions that reduced end-to-end translation latency.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Product Owner & Scala Developer</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">Ryte &middot; Feb 2022 &ndash; Jun 2023</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Evolved the platform API into an API-as-a-Product: developer experience vision, DX conversion funnel, and monetisation strategy. Led development of authentication, CRM integration, and transactional email services in Scala.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Backend Developer & Scrum Master</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">Exaring (waipu.tv) &middot; Jul 2019 &ndash; Jan 2022</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Developed and operated ~60 microservices powering waipu.tv's IPTV platform in Kotlin and Spring Boot. Managed infrastructure on Kubernetes/AWS with Terraform. Part-time Scrum Master for the Business Systems team.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Lead Software Engineer</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">FreshDetect &middot; Nov 2018 &ndash; Jun 2019</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Led technical direction for a food-safety startup: evaluated ML approaches for spectroscopy-based freshness detection, prototyped solutions, and provided in-house consulting on architecture and processes.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">Data & Software Engineer</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">FreshDetect &middot; Mar 2016 &ndash; Nov 2018</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Built internal data analysis tools, data access libraries, and automated validation pipelines. Introduced software development processes. Administered Linux servers and PostgreSQL databases.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">Education</h2>
        <ul class="ledger">
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">M.Sc. Applied Computer Science</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">Hochschule Trier &middot; 2015 &ndash; 2018</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Environmental and Business Informatics.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="ledger-title">B.Sc. Applied Computer Science</span>
                <p class="ledger-meta">Hochschule Trier &middot; 2011 &ndash; 2016</p>
                <p class="ledger-text">Engineering focus. Including roles as research assistant, software developer, and tutor.</p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">How I work</h2>
        <p class="body-text">I believe the best solutions emerge when teams understand the "why" behind what they build. I combine technical depth with a strong emphasis on collaboration, clear communication, and pragmatic problem-solving. I care about getting the right things done well — not just shipping fast.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid section">
        <h2 class="index label">Contact</h2>
        <div>
            <p class="body-text">I'm always open to conversations about technology, product development, and team leadership — whether that's exchanging ideas, exploring collaborations, or discussing new opportunities. Feel free to reach out!</p>
            <p class="contact"><a href="mailto:patrick@patrickscheid.de">patrick@patrickscheid.de</a> &middot; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pscheid92/">LinkedIn</a> &middot; <a href="https://github.com/pscheid92">GitHub</a></p>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .avatar {
        width: 96px;
        height: 96px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: block;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .lede {
        font-family: var(--font-text);
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .body-text {
        font-family: var(--font-text);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .ledger .ledger-meta {
        margin: 0.1rem 0 0.35rem;
    }

    .contact {
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (max-width: 63.99rem) {
        .avatar {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .lede {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
        }
    }
</style>
